Dialogue: 0,00:00:00.00,00:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Play your own videos with FrameIsle.\NNo account or included movies.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:05.00,00:00:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Add Local Folder and authorize it\Nusing the system file picker.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:26.80,00:00:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Add your NAS address and account.\NThis recording uses a local test server.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:53.39,00:01:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,SMB discovers shared folders automatically.\NChoose a share to browse its videos.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:05.64,00:01:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Open a video to start playback.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:11.01,00:01:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Drag the timeline to find your place.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:18.35,00:01:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Enter full screen, then use the exit button\Nto return to the player.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:31.80,00:01:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Tap the star to save this folder.\NOpen it again from Favorite Folders.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:49.03,00:02:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the video menu and choose Cache Locally.\NKeep the app open until the download finishes.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:03.04,00:02:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Play the completed local copy from Local Cache.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:15.20,00:02:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Delete the cached copy when you no longer need it.\NThe original NAS file is kept.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:25.43,00:02:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the connection as a QR code.\NPasswords are excluded by default.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:36.04,00:02:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Import a QR image and review it before saving.\NEnter the password separately on the other device.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:53.99,00:02:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,More help: Settings → Getting Started.\Nframeisle.icqnft.com
